  "pathBeforeYouBegin": [
    "## Before you begin\n\nYou need:\n\n- A Grafana Cloud account. To sign up, refer to [Grafana Cloud](https://grafana.com/signup/cloud/connect-account).\n- Permission to create alert rules.\n- Some familiarity with PromQL. If PromQL is new to you, try [Create your first alert rule](https://grafana.com/docs/learning-paths/alerting-first-rule/) first. It uses Builder mode, so you don't need to write any query.\n\nThe next milestone installs **QuickPizza**, a demo pizza shop that generates real metrics. Querying it doesn't count toward your Grafana Cloud usage."
